 \includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{Euler-Map41}    \caption{\small Map of the Northern Pacific, representing the Eastern part of Asia and the Northern part of America, from Euler's \emph{Atlas Geographicus} (Berlin, 1753) and it is drawn using Delisle's method.} 
