\end{equation}

Now, the work of~\cite{arenas2023complexity} demonstrates the following relationship when the feature distribution $\mathcal{D}_p$ is assumed to be the \emph{uniform distribution}, which is a specific case of the fully factorized distribution considered in this paper. For any $f, \x$, it holds that:

