So, we have proved that $\bar{\mathcal{Q}} \neq \emptyset$. \\
 \noindent  {\it Step 2: $\bar{\mathcal{Q}} \subseteq \{p \in \mathcal{Q}: NA(p) \mbox{ holds} \}. $}\\
